Client confirmation details




I've successfully implemented the client confirmation system for quotations. Here's what was created:

Database Schema (db/migration_client_confirmation.sql):
client_confirmation - Main table for confirmation records
client_confirmation_days - Stores which property is confirmed for each day
client_confirmation_rooms - Stores which room category is confirmed for each property
Model (application/models/Client_confirmation_model.php):
Methods to fetch confirmations by token, quotation ID
Methods to get confirmation details with days and rooms
Methods to save/update confirmations
Methods to fetch quotation properties for confirmation
Controller (application/controllers/Client_confirmation.php):
view($token) - Public view for clients to confirm their quotation
submit_confirmation() - Process client confirmation submissions
index() - Admin list view of all confirmations
view_confirmation($id) - Admin view of specific confirmation details
generate_confirmation($quotation_id) - Generate confirmation link for a quotation
Views:
client_view.php - Client-facing confirmation page with option/property/room selection
admin_list.php - Admin list of all confirmations
admin_view.php - Admin view of confirmation details
admin_script.php - DataTable initialization for admin list
